# 📘 Statistics & Data Analysis Project

## 📌 Project Overview
This project contains:
- Part A (Theory)
- Part B (Practical)

Implemented using Python in Jupyter Notebook.

---

## 📂 Files Included
- `Part A & B.ipynb` → Main notebook file
- `README.md` → Project documentation

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used
- Python 3
- Jupyter Notebook
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib

---

## 📖 Part A – Theory Topics
- Types of Data
- Descriptive Statistics
- Inferential Statistics
- Mean, Median & Mode
- Variance & Standard Deviation

---

## 💻 Part B – Practical Topics
- Dataset Loading
- Data Cleaning
- Statistical Analysis
- Histogram Creation
- Data Visualization
- Python Coding

---

## ▶️ How to Run

```bash
pip install pandas numpy matplotlib
jupyter notebook
```

Open:
```bash
Part A & B.ipynb
```

Run all cells.

---

## 🎯 Learning Objectives
- Learn Statistics Basics
- Perform Data Analysis
- Create Visualizations
- Understand Python Practical Concepts

